### Get all makes

GET https://vpic.nhtsa.dot.gov/api/vehicles/GetAllMakes?format=json
Accept: application/json


### Get vehicle types for make

GET https://vpic.nhtsa.dot.gov/api/vehicles/GetVehicleTypesForMakeId/448?format=json
Accept: application/json


### Get models for make + year + vehicle type

GET https://vpic.nhtsa.dot.gov/api/vehicles/GetModelsForMakeIdYear/makeId/474/modelyear/2015/vehicletype/truck?format=json
Accept: application/json